    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="ea33a0df-9983-5cd8-8615-1dc0d2779400" activityNameId="ae3021c5-1611-5c71-bad8-00084edd5d03" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Charger, for electric scooter</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Charger, for electric scooter
This dataset describes the production of a charger suitable for an electric scooter. The entries are given as a function of kg of device. The original data was collected for a device of approximately 3 kg weight. The dataset is based on direct inspection of existing commercial devices of current technology.;
UUID: d2f11c80-00bc-39c9-b9e4-e9eaefcea9c7
The dataset takes as input the various electronic components required to build the charger and includes the components" production efforts. Assembly energy not included due to lack of data. The dataset returns the assembled device and production waste as a by-product.
Location: Unspecified
Technology: Unspecified
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 2350000 kg
Sampling: Direct inspection of a typical device of common technology. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d2f11c80-00bc-39c9-b9e4-e9eaefcea9c7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
